- bass-drum kit, the one that you see on this [?]. My teacher said, \"What are you doing? \" I said, \"This is a diagram of a new drum set, a new kind of a drum set. \" I explained to him  that most drummers only use one bass drum. I've got two bass drums. He said, \"Work on that. \" So he passed me on that. I was interested ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10931$10BE4A9B-4FE4-469B-8485-20B6D1188D95", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "b87c3443190746484cd0f2e7dbd09d6bf8f26a4f", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/135.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10931$90E06E2D-8A9A-4813-A2DD-D5FE7E3F170C", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "33eabf49c5b67bcf22e11ff387a4035cb991d4a8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 50, "id": "Q50"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10931$A8C78D3A-76D0-4E39-96F3-B54831987166", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10931$A40081FA-58CC-44E4-890F-6EC76C8A59FA", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "6728b1d69fb03de3e91c83a040b2b8876a0c8810", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q10931$82F950E4-8C3A-43DF-A55F-0238C41D80CB", "rank": "normal"}]}}